## 📦 How to Run

1. Save `index.html`, `style.css`, `app.js` in the same folder.
2. Open in a modern browser.
3. Add clips, add transitions, adjust durations.
4. Click **▶ Render & Export** to generate a PNG of all frames.
5. (Optional) Install FFmpeg to generate real MP4 (see note below).

