## 📦 Notes

- Works in **Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari**.
- **CapturePage** uses a clone of the DOM — works best on static pages. Avoid iframes or complex dynamic content.
- **Freehand** draws on top of the selection rect. Press `Esc` to cancel.
- **Preview text** can be edited by double-clicking the preview box or by clicking the editor when the tool is set to text.

