This prototype demonstrates the core mechanics of a destruction shooting game with fluid simulation using WebGL and shaders. You can extend it further based on your needs.

To build a **Meeting Room Reservation System**, we'll design a **full-stack web application** using:

- **Front-end**: HTML, CSS, JavaScript (vanilla + some vanilla state management)
- **Back-end**: Node.js + Express
- **Database**: SQLite (lightweight, single-file)
- **Authentication**: Simple session-based (admin vs. user)
- **Real-time updates**: Broadcast via Server-Sent Events (SSE) to keep the UI in sync

