| Play/Pause             | Click the play button below the timeline.                                 |
| Export                 | Click "Export" to download a JSON file with all your data.                |
| Import                 | Click "Import" and choose a JSON file saved from another session.         |
| Clear                  | Click "Clear" to remove all bookmarks.                                     |

